      "title": "Two callers",
      "items": [
        "Search Documentation asks for 10 results and opens the chosen page URL in the browser (extension.ts:264-286)",
        "The #docrag Copilot tool asks for 3 and returns title, source URL and chunk text (copilotIntegration.ts:32-61)"
      ]
