    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Ranking",
      "items": [
        "The keyword half is an exact substring match, so natural-language queries usually rely on the vector half (storageEngine.ts:188)",
        "Vector search is brute-force cosine over every stored vector, all parsed from JSON on each query (searchEngine.ts:79-91)",
        "Only ranks are fused, never raw scores (searchEngine.ts:121-147)"
      ]
    }
